# Keep working copies byte-identical across hosts. Embedded runtimes, -init
# templates, generated bundles and packages copy these files verbatim, so a
# Windows core.autocrlf checkout must not inject CRLF (e.g. "bash\r" shebangs,
# "\r" in schema.pb comments, or differing data.ts copies).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Generated bundle manifests bind exact file bytes. Preserve them when a
# Windows checkout enables core.autocrlf, including JSON and binary payloads.
examples/complete/Generated/** -text
